{"about_the_game":"In a world where dark magic and betrayal fester like a venomous wound, the kingdom stands on the precipice of chaos. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game thrusts players into the vengeful shoes of a cruel demon, a being of immense power who was once bound by a fateful pact with the kingdom's revered king. The demon, in his dark and malevolent glory, had offered his infernal might to the kingdom in a desperate time. In return, the king was to grant the demon lord a single, sinister boon of his choosing, to be claimed at his discretion.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAs the game begins, the demon is intent on fulfilling his end of the pact, invoking his right to the boon he so desires. However, when he presents his request to King, the king brazenly refuses, breaking the ancient pact and leaving the demon seething with anger and thirst for revenge.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe demon's wrath knows no bounds. With the kingdom's dark magic coursing through his veins, he gathers a legion of demonic minions and sets his sights, intent on tearing it asunder. He is driven by a thirst for revenge, not only against the treacherous king but against the entire kingdom that betrayed him.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe player assumes the role of the demon, leading a relentless campaign to subjugate the Kingdom by force. The game mechanics focus on the demon's immense power, allowing players to wield dark magic, summon demonic armies, and unleash devastating spells upon the kingdom. Battles are epic, as the demon lays siege to the kingdom's strongholds, confronts powerful knights, and faces off against formidable magical defenses.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAs the story unfolds, players witness the devastation wrought by the demons's forces, the turmoil in the kingdom, and the struggles of those who oppose the demon lord's reign. The player must confront not only the physical challenges of conquest but also the moral implications of their actions.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWill the demon succeed in his quest for vengeance, or will the kingdom and its people find a way to defy the demon lord and rectify the broken pact? The fate of the Kingdom rests in the player's hands, and their choices will shape the kingdom's destiny.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1952670?t=1727374056","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1952670?t=1727374056","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952670/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1727374056","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952670/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1727374056","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Blood, death, gore, violence"},"demos":[{"appid":2076760,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"In a world where dark magic and betrayal fester like a venomous wound, the kingdom stands on the precipice of chaos. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game thrusts players into the vengeful shoes of a cruel demon, a being of immense power who was once bound by a fateful pact with the kingdom's revered king. The demon, in his dark and malevolent glory, had offered his infernal might to the kingdom in a desperate time. In return, the king was to grant the demon lord a single, sinister boon of his choosing, to be claimed at his discretion.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAs the game begins, the demon is intent on fulfilling his end of the pact, invoking his right to the boon he so desires. However, when he presents his request to King, the king brazenly refuses, breaking the ancient pact and leaving the demon seething with anger and thirst for revenge.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe demon's wrath knows no bounds. With the kingdom's dark magic coursing through his veins, he gathers a legion of demonic minions and sets his sights, intent on tearing it asunder. He is driven by a thirst for revenge, not only against the treacherous king but against the entire kingdom that betrayed him.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe player assumes the role of the demon, leading a relentless campaign to subjugate the Kingdom by force. The game mechanics focus on the demon's immense power, allowing players to wield dark magic, summon demonic armies, and unleash devastating spells upon the kingdom. Battles are epic, as the demon lays siege to the kingdom's strongholds, confronts powerful knights, and faces off against formidable magical defenses.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAs the story unfolds, players witness the devastation wrought by the demons's forces, the turmoil in the kingdom, and the struggles of those who oppose the demon lord's reign. The player must confront not only the physical challenges of conquest but also the moral implications of their actions.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWill the demon succeed in his quest for vengeance, or will the kingdom and its people find a way to defy the demon lord and rectify the broken pact? The fate of the Kingdom rests in the player's hands, and their choices will shape the kingdom's destiny.","developers":["2.5D Gaming Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952670/header.jpg?t=1727374056","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":256980182,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256980182/movie480.mp4?t=1699194966","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.c